<BaseLayout title="Maintenance">
  <h1>Maintenance</h1>
  <p>Maintenance records should include date, odometer reading, work performed, parts used, and source of the specification. Keep receipts and record the exact product and part numbers.</p>
  <h2>In this section</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/service-schedule/">Service schedule</a></li>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/fluids/">Fluids and capacities</a></li>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/tires-wheels/">Tires and wheels</a></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="note">Follow the maintenance schedule displayed for the vehicle and the applicable market. Do not assume a generic interval applies to every engine or operating condition.</div>
</BaseLayout>
